  "summary": "Malicious code in @or-sdk/deployments (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from a GitHub release and uses it to execute a bundled 727KB obfuscated script (math_init.js) at install time. The script is obfuscated with a custom decoder over a large encoded string array, hiding its behaviour from inspection. The package also depends on other packages in the same namespace that are known-malicious. Installing this package runs the obfuscated payload automatically during npm install.",
